configs.doc:
TraceConfig configures synchronous span events. Its zero value is usable;
disclosure and status changes are off. Callbacks and Logger remain caller-owned
and must support concurrent calls and return promptly. No context is retained.

Endpoint is a Standard Webhooks HMAC destination. URL must be absolute HTTPS;
HTTP is permitted only for localhost or a literal loopback IP. Userinfo and
fragments are refused. Secrets contains 1–8 whsec_-prefixed, standard base64
encoded keys, each decoding to 24–64 bytes. Generate keys with crypto/rand;
use different keys for different endpoints. All keys sign during rotation.
